# 💡 Business Insights & Recommendations

### 1. Focus on the Mass Market segment

Mass Market represents the largest customer group. Targeted engagement and product recommendations can help increase customer activity and value.

### 2. Reactivate inactive customers

The dataset contains **466 customers with no transactions**. These customers can be targeted with appropriate activation and engagement campaigns.

### 3. Strengthen digital channels

The Mobile App represents the highest transaction activity and value among the analyzed channels, indicating strong digital engagement.

### 4. Use RFM segmentation

RFM segments can help differentiate high-value customers from inactive or lower-engagement customers and support targeted customer strategies.

### 5. Monitor transaction categories

Salary generates the highest transaction value, while Transfer and Shopping generate high transaction volumes. These patterns can help prioritize product and engagement strategies.

