# 🔐 Data Privacy

This project should contain only **synthetic, anonymized, public or otherwise authorized data**.

Do not upload:

* Real customer names
* Account numbers
* Bank account details
* Payment information
* Personal contact information
* Passwords or credentials
* Confidential banking records

